{"speciesId":692,"names":{"fr":"Flingouste","es":"Clauncher","en":"Clauncher","ja":"ウデッポウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa pince projette un jet d’eau sous pression suffisamment puissant pour abattre ses proies en plein vol."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Abate a enemigos voladores disparando agua a presión con su enorme pinza como si de una pistola se tratara."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They knock down flying prey by firing compressed water from their massive claws like shooting a pistol."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きな ハサミから 圧縮した 水を ピストルのように 撃ち出し 飛んでいる 獲物を 撃ち落とす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est capable de transformer son corps en canon à eau, grâce à la combustion d’un gaz interne. À bout portant, il peut réduire un rocher en miettes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al explotar el gas que se halla en su interior, expulsa un chorro de agua cual pistola, que a bocajarro es incluso capaz de pulverizar rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Through controlled explosions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内ガスの 爆発で 水を ピストルのように 発射する。 至近距離なら 岩を 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sa pince projette un jet d’eau sous pression suffisamment puissant pour abattre ses proies en plein vol."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Abate a enemigos voladores disparando agua a presión con su enorme pinza como si de una pistola se tratara."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They knock down flying prey by firing compressed water from their massive claws like shooting a pistol."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大きな ハサミから 圧縮した 水を ピストルのように 撃ち出し 飛んでいる 獲物を 撃ち落とす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il est capable de transformer son corps en canon à eau, grâce à la combustion d’un gaz interne. À bout portant, il peut réduire un rocher en miettes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al explotar el gas que se halla en su interior, expulsa un chorro de agua cual pistola, que a bocajarro es incluso capaz de pulverizar rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Through controlled explosions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体内ガスの 爆発で 水を ピストルのように 発射する。 至近距離なら 岩を 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa pince, à la chair délicieuse, tombe parfois. Il se fait alors tout petit et se cache le temps qu’elle repousse."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En alguna que otra ocasión se le cae la pinza, y hasta que le crece de nuevo vive aislado. La carne del interior de las pinzas es deliciosa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its claws occasionally fall off, and it keeps a low profile until they grow back. The meat of its claws is so delicious!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ハサミは 時々 もげることもあり 再生するまでは コソコソ暮らす。 ハサミの中身は とても美味しいよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se déplace en propulsant de l’eau par sa pince droite. Il n’est cependant pas très agile et est incapable de nager droit."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Para moverse, expulsa chorros de agua por su pinza derecha. Tiene muy mal equilibrio, por lo que es incapaz de nadar en línea recta."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It moves around by jetting water from its right pincer. It has a poor sense of balance, so it’s terrible at swimming straight."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"右の ハサミから 水を 噴き出し 移動。 バランスが 悪いので まっすぐ 泳ぐのは 下手くそ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"S’il perd ses pinces au combat, d’autres repoussent à la place. La chair qu’elles contiennent est un mets très apprécié à Galar."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aunque pierda una pinza en combate, volverá a crecerle. La carne del interior de sus pinzas es considerada un auténtico manjar en Galar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Clauncher’s claws can fall off during battle, but they’ll regenerate. The meat inside the claws is popular as a delicacy in Galar."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ハサミは 戦いで 取れても 再生される。 ハサミの 中身は ガラルでは 珍味として 人気だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il concentre du gaz dans sa pince droite et le fait exploser pour tirer une rafale d’eau sur ses ennemis, comme une balle de pistolet."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Acalla a sus enemigos con balas de agua que dispara haciendo explotar el gas de su pinza derecha."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"By detonating gas that accumulates in its right claw, this Pokémon launches water like a bullet. This is how Clauncher defeats its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"右腕の ハサミの 中に 溜まる ガスの 爆発で 弾丸のように 水を 発射し 敵を 倒す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":692,"moves":[{"name":"vice-grip","learns":[[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"level-up",25],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",25],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",25],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",25],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",35],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",35],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[25,"machine",